pi-ds-minimal-mode adapts the two-phase prompt/tool-catalog anchoring design
pioneered by "dsh-anchored-standard" and "pi-ds-anchored", MIT-licensed
community presets for DeepSeek Harness and Pi respectively:

  https://github.com/hank9999/pi-ds-anchored
  https://github.com/xiaobright/dsh-anchored-standard

The byte-stable Minimal alignment prompt is retained for behavioral parity
with the DeepSeek Harness Minimal persona:

  You are a helpful software engineer assistant.

The DeepSeek Harness Minimal persona originates from:

  https://github.com/deepseek-ai/deepseek-harness

