This implementation is independently written against Pi's extension API. It
does not bundle DeepSeek Harness code, pi-ds-anchored code, or Pi runtime
code. The minimal-mode behavior is extended to cover both DeepSeek V4 Flash
and DeepSeek V4 Pro model ids, whereas the upstream pi-ds-anchored preset
targets DeepSeek V4 Pro only.

